        <!-- COMPOSE TAB -->
        <div class="pu-tab-pane" id="pu-pane-compose">
          <p style="padding:14px 22px 4px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);line-height:1.6">Sends an in-app notification (bell icon) and/or an email to every matching seller, right now. Use "Policy update" whenever you edit Terms or Privacy — it labels the notice accordingly and nudges recipients to review it.</p>
