          <p style="padding:14px 22px 4px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);line-height:1.6">These rules check automatically on a schedule and message the right sellers with zero manual work — e.g. nudge a seller whose free trial expires in 3 days. Each seller gets a rule at most once every 20 hours. Toggle a rule on to activate it; edit its wording any time.</p>
